sequenceDiagram
accTitle: The SDK refreshes role credentials before signing S3 requests
accDescr: The EC2 application obtains temporary role credentials through instance metadata, signs a scoped S3 upload, and refreshes credentials as they approach expiration.
participant A as EC2 application SDK
participant M as Instance metadata
participant S as S3 bucket
Note over A,M: Instance profile supplies a restricted EC2 role
A->>M: Request current temporary role credentials
M-->>A: Access key, secret, token and expiration
A->>S: Signed PutObject to processed/ object
S-->>A: Upload result
A->>M: Refresh credentials before expiration
